  "cues": [
    {
      "cue_id": "EP010-C01",
      "text": "最后一秒归零。整排楼的灯，一盏接一盏熄灭。一轮红月，从楼缝里升起来，楼下响起桌椅翻倒的声音。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/speed1p3/EP010-C01.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "b8f96c05d8b8fd51141226991b67f1055a4150a927f454f4d3b76a9fa006aef1",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.530666666666667,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 226,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 0,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/EP010-C01.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "7af5d3211d66f7fa9a3707c76fdd778d33cf4b1d1bf26e0af80adb624ee3b595",
      "source_duration_seconds": 9.8,
      "sample_count": 361472
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP010-C02",
      "text": "夏凛拉了拉门链，回头看我。我在厨房，把卡式炉的火调到最旺，红油翻滚。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/speed1p3/EP010-C02.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "0ebc602e91613732878ceaa71295a3a792d2225ab3d156e2c0941f64ada959b7",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.0455,
      "start_frame": 229,
      "end_frame": 411,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/EP010-C02.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "f585e4043ca87be191953b795ebeb94fbf9333e7995d16f39ce23b39c991adc2",
      "source_duration_seconds": 7.9,
      "sample_count": 290184
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP010-C03",
      "text": "她说，外面天都塌了，你在煮火锅？我说，天塌了，才要吃好点。毛肚，牛肉，蔬菜，我都摆好了。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/speed1p3/EP010-C03.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "0ef56f09209827e675f370acbe47964fe358e666b589c7391d7e8567f5690ef6",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.8855208333333335,
      "start_frame": 414,
      "end_frame": 651,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/EP010-C03.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "ab955522b3f1910e124480b7a943a02a52a5e46022135cf634e59ab17cf34da4",
      "source_duration_seconds": 10.274844,
      "sample_count": 378505
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP010-C04",
      "text": "就在这时，王大富扑到门上。他满手是血，拍着门喊，陈屿，开门，十根金条，全给你。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/speed1p3/EP010-C04.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "d47d5ea647d4213200ba11738ef045a181c1d26d396172f68f2f8541d49ca665",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.005770833333333,
      "start_frame": 654,
      "end_frame": 865,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/EP010-C04.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "35d317974e3679a28aa809cacdee793900e5dc6e9ce7c3f4aa57e3eaf76d5271",
      "source_duration_seconds": 9.1,
      "sample_count": 336277
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP010-C05",
      "text": "我夹起毛肚，在红汤里涮了七下。隔着门，我说，当初在群里说我借钱囤货是傻子的时候，你可没这么客气。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/speed1p3/EP010-C05.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "c789f5bd6e88ced4fa42bc30e6b143cfeabbb3c3bdf7788cb3f88e2b591b7df9",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 8.3916875,
      "start_frame": 868,
      "end_frame": 1120,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/EP010-C05.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "d054e0af5a0758610bba54cc075d677e7c20111228de71f8cb612a7a6534ff40",
      "source_duration_seconds": 10.9,
      "sample_count": 402801
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP010-C06",
      "text": "楼梯转角，一道青灰色的人影扑了出来。王大富一声惨叫。夏凛说，他会死。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/speed1p3/EP010-C06.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "cebd847ef003c307ef1de791f36f93a72493838c1146377686eed89e3d3a6249",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 5.6951875,
      "start_frame": 1123,
      "end_frame": 1294,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/EP010-C06.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "193154d0bed0776898d59e365353eb0ecbdee52d8623f3a605dc805c3b2d8649",
      "source_duration_seconds": 7.4,
      "sample_count": 273369
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP010-C07",
      "text": "我放下筷子。我不救人，我只保证，门前干净。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/speed1p3/EP010-C07.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "4ff0294b14305ec9018519b9e6b40e71af8126a2b19f78491f0ed76dfd01f019",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 3.5970625,
      "start_frame": 1297,
      "end_frame": 1405,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/EP010-C07.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "bc18735e7a8eac52204a9fd78f69798ce59c4ddb998b230c8c92c40d6cc4e869",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "sample_count": 172659
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP010-C08",
      "text": "我拿起院灯的控制器，按了下去。两束白光，同时照向转角。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/speed1p3/EP010-C08.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "e7875a03c45229150d75a64418808f4e28d4583c18570026da2de5481b107a5b",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 4.388458333333333,
      "start_frame": 1408,
      "end_frame": 1540,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/EP010-C08.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "9c90ce4d8b376c77616fbaacc43427db548a56e0a0123281b5212162fb98e8fc",
      "source_duration_seconds": 5.7,
      "sample_count": 210646
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP010-C09",
      "text": "那道人影捂着眼睛，往后缩了半步，发出一声尖啸。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/speed1p3/EP010-C09.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "912d2d96db3534345a320fb505fee47af2e1f609b36933a82d217bff8a555ff5",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 4.008916666666667,
      "start_frame": 1543,
      "end_frame": 1664,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/EP010-C09.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "9a17d0eb1943703fda234d1d5269f9706367c8656a054e22626646568d78684a",
      "source_duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "sample_count": 192428
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP010-C10",
      "text": "王大富连滚带爬冲回对门，砰地关上。他的惨叫，戛然而止。夏凛看着我说，你早就准备好了灯。我说，怕光，怕火，耳朵灵，我写过。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/speed1p3/EP010-C10.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "a15e86ca45d3ce28e6cca77887b98cc175e04e6bdf21064948ddd2a98da5ba2a",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 10.465041666666666,
      "start_frame": 1667,
      "end_frame": 1981,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/EP010-C10.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "22cb7010020694a4035d5d6ae4e3b76c97473e5e3cf0b0026e4d1bc7070c3b2d",
      "source_duration_seconds": 13.6,
      "sample_count": 502322
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP010-C11",
      "text": "可我还没来得及松一口气，楼梯另一头，传来一个女人的声音。陈屿！陈屿，你在吗？我来了！\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/speed1p3/EP010-C11.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "428864ea34974360021792fcbcf0ce694118fe36453880b467dafe725cec7253",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 7.346208333333333,
      "start_frame": 1984,
      "end_frame": 2205,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/EP010-C11.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "755a64efd09b6004c3054b8ef1e402a0c19a98958841e8ff1bac2f9ebba16705",
      "source_duration_seconds": 9.589844,
      "sample_count": 352618
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP010-C12",
      "text": "是许知意。她白大褂撕裂，浑身是血，手里攥着那张纸卡。她身后，三道人影，正追上来。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/speed1p3/EP010-C12.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "4dafdd7c892ae4c0c105522700ada91ab0d7207b969d0968127453cc3c27d716",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.668020833333333,
      "start_frame": 2208,
      "end_frame": 2409,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/EP010-C12.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "03e8afe9656d0abfc3f7386f58dba0d9d6d8b122782497b8d759d11e961678a7",
      "source_duration_seconds": 8.695875,
      "sample_count": 320065
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP010-C13",
      "text": "我对她喊，往亮的地方走，别离开这束光。\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/speed1p3/EP010-C13.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "ac71ff9c90d240e2487db3e7df8b694a98a8ceec1d7c2471e4a3e458267a2540",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 3.1115833333333334,
      "start_frame": 2412,
      "end_frame": 2506,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/EP010-C13.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "100a5efa9eae87468cdb4d4a0d482b5cd92dbb591b4c4041651f644289242770",
      "source_duration_seconds": 4.086719,
      "sample_count": 149356
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP010-C14",
      "text": "手机亮起一行红字，检测到屋外幸存者，请求入住。开启入口，将暴露安全屋位置，是否确认？\n",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/speed1p3/EP010-C14.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "0b815626ad5764372e8ea1ae941dfd42396b6bbaff5c53c8dde7af1e3486bcd9",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.798,
      "start_frame": 2509,
      "end_frame": 2713,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/EP010-C14.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "36aff8ea0e088e2f11e6305a78fc287ae04274690fa26a3f4729bc136e1fa8bc",
      "source_duration_seconds": 8.870031,
      "sample_count": 326304
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "EP010-C15",
      "text": "夏凛站到我身后，短棍举起。我的手，按在门锁上。门外，她的呼吸，已经贴到了门板上。",
      "audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/speed1p3/EP010-C15.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "d43109797450fad6689640f05e3e5d2f6a1ca1bde8f5f6dd11af4a5134ed738e",
      "actual_duration_seconds": 6.460020833333333,
      "start_frame": 2716,
      "end_frame": 2910,
      "external_gap_before_frames": 3,
      "source_audio_path": "episodes/EP010/audio/EP010-C15.mp3",
      "source_audio_sha256": "52c49f523c839039ac8173d1bdf8a144af4cffc1bf855936c452e3e79a74105c",
      "source_duration_seconds": 8.4,
      "sample_count": 310081
    }
  ],
